<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Polacode on Wayne's blog | 偉恩的部落格 | 技術博客</title><link>https://blog.wayne-project.com/tags/polacode/</link><description>Recent content in Polacode on Wayne's blog | 偉恩的部落格 | 技術博客</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-tw</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 14 Feb 2023 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.wayne-project.com/tags/polacode/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>【Polacode】一款好用的 VSCode 截圖套件推薦</title><link>https://blog.wayne-project.com/2023-02-14/vscode-plugin-polacode/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Feb 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.wayne-project.com/2023-02-14/vscode-plugin-polacode/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52688573055_35766ac7fc_o.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 【Polacode】一款好用的 VSCode 截圖套件推薦" /&gt;&lt;style&gt;
